00:21:25.734 --> 00:21:28.033
Always coming in the mail, being
all like, "Where's my money?"

00:21:28.033 --> 00:21:29.601
For the last time, I don't know.

00:21:29.601 --> 00:21:32.067
Call it canned tuna,
