But commanders can't lay eggs,
so advantage Eagles.

00:21:42.167 --> 00:21:43.868
From the City of Brotherly Lock.

00:21:46.167 --> 00:21:48.634
♪ B-B-B-Bengals and the Jets ♪

00:21:48.634 --> 00:21:50.901
Elton John may be known to rock,
but Cincinnati's

00:21:50.901 --> 00:21:52.934
the one brewing up a big batch
of chili and spaghetti

00:21:52.934 --> 00:21:54.534
in a lock pot.

00:21:55.901 --> 00:21:57.601
49ers versus Broncos.

00:21:57.601 --> 00:22:00.534
It's the city by the bay against
the horse that eats the hay.

00:22:00.534 --> 00:22:03.467
49ers pan for gold,
horses get locked in pens.

00:22:03.467 --> 00:22:04.901
Easy Denver lock.

00:22:06.901 --> 00:22:09.133
And, finally,
Lions versus Vikings.

00:22:09.133 --> 00:22:12.267
For ball spiking,
lineman striking, fan sacking,

00:22:12.267 --> 00:22:14.334
you just can't beat
the Detroit Lions.

00:22:14.334 --> 00:22:17.033
Motor City lock.

00:22:17.033 --> 00:22:18.234
That's all for
this week's Lock Box.

00:22:18.234 --> 00:22:19.367
Happy watching.

00:22:19.367 --> 00:22:21.634
I'll see you
