00:22:32.567 --> 00:22:33.868
-Some entertainment news.

00:22:33.868 --> 00:22:36.601
A new "Star Wars" show, "Andor,"
just came out on Disney+.

00:22:36.601 --> 00:22:37.934
It's getting great reviews.

00:22:37.934 --> 00:22:40.868
And I saw that the show
introduces a new droid character

00:22:40.868 --> 00:22:44.701
named B2EMO.

00:22:44.701 --> 00:22:46.300
Can we take a look at B2EMO?

00:22:48.734 --> 00:22:52.100
Honestly, he doesn't really
look that emo.

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:54.100
Can we see some clips of him
from the show?

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:57.100
-It's not a phase.
It's who I am.

00:22:57.100 --> 00:22:59.601
Security confiscated
my wallet chain

00:22:59.601 --> 00:23:01.868
at the My Chemical Romance show.

00:23:01.868 --> 00:23:04.934
They're not cigarettes,
Dad, they're cloves.

00:23:04.934 --> 00:23:07.801
And I'm 18, so leave me alone.

00:23:07.801 --> 00:23:09.467
Has anyone seen my

00:23:09.467 --> 00:23:11.634
"Nightmare Before Christmas"
beanie?

00:23:11.634 --> 00:23:14.033
Just pick me up
at the mall at 10:00

00:23:14.033 --> 00:23:16.167
and please don't embarrass me.

00:23:16.167 --> 00:23:18.634
This whole star system
is bull[bleep]

00:23:18.634 --> 00:23:20.334
-Oh, my God.
That was interesting.

00:23:20.334 --> 00:23:21.567
Now I get it.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:23:21.567 --> 00:23:23.601
-Wow!
-I get it.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:26.300
Some more entertainment news.

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:29.000
Tomorrow, "Avatar"
will be re-released in theaters

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.400
all across the country.

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:32.234
The movie originally
came out in 2009.

00:23:32.234 --> 00:23:33.467
That was a long time ago.

00:23:33.467 --> 00:23:35.167
Higgins, do you remember
where you were when you --

00:23:35.167 --> 00:23:37.100
back in 2009,
when you first saw "Avatar"?

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:38.734
-Oh, yeah, of course.

00:23:38.734 --> 00:23:41.234
I was dancing to "Boom Boom Pow"
by the Black Eyed Peas...

00:23:41.234 --> 00:23:42.334
-Uh-huh.

00:23:42.334 --> 00:23:43.801
-...when my friend, the Octomom,

00:23:43.801 --> 00:23:47.000
texted me the "Avatar" trailer
on my BlackBerry Storm.

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:49.734
And as a thank-you,
I poked her on Facebook.

00:23:49.734 --> 00:23:51.300
-Oh.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:23:53.601 --> 00:23:55.567
-Yo, I still remember
where I was

00:23:55.567 --> 00:23:57.100
when I found out about "Avatar."

00:23:57.100 --> 00:24:02.267
I was hanging out with my BFFs,
Taylor Lautner and Susan Boyle.

00:24:02.267 --> 00:24:04.767
And we were
ghost-riding the whip

00:24:04.767 --> 00:24:07.434
when Susan starts telling me
how good "Avatar" is.

00:24:07.434 --> 00:24:10.467
So, I told her, "Susan Boyle,
I'mma let you finish,

00:24:10.467 --> 00:24:12.734
but 'Sisterhood of
the Traveling Pants 2'

00:24:12.734 --> 00:24:14.300
is the best movie of the year."

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:16.868
-Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Yeah, yeah.

00:24:16.868 --> 00:24:18.100
You want to know where I was

00:24:18.100 --> 00:24:19.667
when I first heard about
"Avatar"?

00:24:19.667 --> 00:24:22.434
I was doing a flash mob with
Snooki, JWoww,

00:24:22.434 --> 00:24:25.367
and The Situation's cousin,
The Circumstance.

00:24:25.367 --> 00:24:27.734
And when we realized
we all forgot to water

00:24:27.734 --> 00:24:30.934
our FarmVille crops,
so we drove to my place

00:24:30.934 --> 00:24:32.667
in my Nissan Cube
while blasting

00:24:32.667 --> 00:24:35.501
the "Glee" soundtrack,
because we're big Gleeks.

00:24:35.501 --> 00:24:38.267
And I heard an ad
for "Avatar" on the radio

00:24:38.267 --> 00:24:41.567
while Snooki was asking me if I
was Team Edward or Team Jacob.

00:24:41.567 --> 00:24:46.968
-Man, 2009 was a different time.

00:24:46.968 --> 00:24:50.901
-2009?
Mine was from this morning.

00:24:53.901 --> 00:24:57.067
-Hey, guys, I read that
battery-powered planes

00:24:57.067 --> 00:24:59.167
are gaining traction
among major airlines.

00:24:59.167 --> 00:25:01.567
They're set to be
in the air by 2028.

00:25:01.567 --> 00:25:02.734
Yeah, battery-powered planes.

00:25:02.734 --> 00:25:04.167
Actually, they've been
around for a while.

00:25:04.167 --> 00:25:08.234
In fact, Spirit's entire fleet
runs on four AAA batteries.

00:25:10.067 --> 00:25:11.734
It's true.

00:25:11.734 --> 00:25:13.133
I heard about
a woman in Washington

00:25:13.133 --> 00:25:14.601
who allegedly stole a car
and didn't have

00:25:14.601 --> 00:25:15.667
a great getaway plan.

00:25:15.667 --> 00:25:16.734
Check this out.

00:25:16.734 --> 00:25:18.200
-If you plan to steal a car,

00:25:18.200 --> 00:25:20.467
don't drive into
freshly poured concrete.

00:25:20.467 --> 00:25:22.234
Lakewood police say
the person who tried to

00:25:22.234 --> 00:25:24.734
make it out with this
Mini Cooper did just that.

00:25:24.734 --> 00:25:27.334
They got out and tried to run
but were arrested anyway.

00:25:27.334 --> 00:25:28.634
Police say the driver was

00:25:28.634 --> 00:25:30.834
holding a bottle of whiskey
at the time.

00:25:30.834 --> 00:25:34.200
-Yeah, you didn't need to
tell us that last part.

00:25:34.200 --> 00:25:36.734
We assumed. Guys, get this.

00:25:36.734 --> 00:25:38.234
Under a new law in California,

00:25:38.234 --> 00:25:40.434
employers will
soon be banned from screening

00:25:40.434 --> 00:25:42.300
employees for marijuana.

00:25:42.300 --> 00:25:45.133
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah. That's right.

00:25:45.133 --> 00:25:48.000
Employers will no longer be able
to drug-test people.

00:25:48.000 --> 00:25:50.534
But if you ask me, they're still
trying to find ways around it.

00:25:50.534 --> 00:25:51.968
Here are some of the questions
that they're asking

00:25:51.968 --> 00:25:53.033
on the job application.

00:25:53.033 --> 00:25:54.167
First up, it says...

00:26:00.367 --> 00:26:02.634
You know what I'm saying?

00:26:02.634 --> 00:26:03.734
Next up, it says...

00:26:10.400 --> 00:26:11.567
-Okay.

00:26:11.567 --> 00:26:15.501
-So I'm thinking...
After that, it says...

00:26:25.133 --> 00:26:26.234
Next, it asks...

00:26:39.234 --> 00:26:40.968
-Whoa!

00:26:41.534 --> 00:26:42.734
-And, finally, it asks...

00:26:48.000 --> 00:26:49.300
-Whoa!

00:26:49.300 --> 00:26:52.100
-Just interesting.
I'm just saying, they're tough.

00:26:52.100 --> 00:26:53.267
Guys, did you see this?

00:26:53.267 --> 00:26:55.033
Residents of Salt Lake City
have reported

00:26:55.033 --> 00:26:58.434
hearing strange music
coming from the sewers.

00:26:58.434 --> 00:27:00.267
Yeah, strange music,
as opposed to

00:27:00.267 --> 00:27:04.167
the totally normal music usually
heard coming from the sewers.

00:27:04.167 --> 00:27:05.334
Finally, a wedding reception
in New Jersey

00:27:05.334 --> 00:27:08.701
had to be relocated
after the floor caved in

00:27:08.701 --> 00:27:10.200
while people were dancing.

00:27:10.200 --> 00:27:12.901
People showed up at the E.R.
like, "Hi.

00:27:12.901 --> 00:27:14.200
I'm here for the
Freedman wedding."

00:27:14.200 --> 00:27:16.567
Yeah. I'm pretty sure it's the
first wedding with

00:27:16.567 --> 00:27:19.701
an open bar and an open floor.

00:27:19.701 --> 00:27:21.667
Guys, it seems like there's
so much going on right now.

00:27:21.667 --> 00:27:23.601
Former President Trump
is being sued by

00:27:23.601 --> 00:27:26.200
New York's attorney general
for fraud.

00:27:26.200 --> 00:27:28.734
The United Nations General
Assembly is underway.

00:27:28.734 --> 00:27:32.868
This weekend, Disney is
re-releasing the movie "Avatar."

00:27:32.868 --> 00:27:34.400
[ Laughter ]

00:27:34.400 --> 00:27:36.133
In theaters.
They're re-releasing it.

00:27:36.133 --> 00:27:38.667
And the FTA is warning people
against following

00:27:38.667 --> 00:27:41.133
a TikTok recipe for
Nyquil chicken.

00:27:41.133 --> 00:27:43.467
There's just so much to go over,

00:27:43.467 --> 00:27:45.133
so let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:27:45.133 --> 00:27:46.400
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:27:46.400 --> 00:27:51.601
♪♪

00:27:51.601 --> 00:27:53.601
First up, Trump.

00:27:53.601 --> 00:27:55.767
The attorney general of New York
is suing him

00:27:55.767 --> 00:27:58.667
for allegedly lying about
the value of his assets.

00:27:58.667 --> 00:28:00.567
Between this,
the January 6th committee,

00:28:00.567 --> 00:28:02.167
and the stolen
classified documents,

00:28:02.167 --> 00:28:04.400
Trump's got more problems
to deal with than...

00:28:04.400 --> 00:28:06.634
the United Nations.

00:28:06.634 --> 00:28:09.367
Their big General Assembly
is this week in New York City,

00:28:09.367 --> 00:28:12.567
and every hotel, restaurant,
and street is absolutely packed.

00:28:12.567 --> 00:28:14.367
But you know what isn't packed?

00:28:14.367 --> 00:28:16.133
A movie theater showing
"Avatar."

00:28:16.133 --> 00:28:17.601
[ Laughter ]

00:28:17.601 --> 00:28:21.033
That movie came out in 2009,
and now it's being re-released.

00:28:21.033 --> 00:28:23.734
Nobody really asked for it,
but here it is.

00:28:23.734 --> 00:28:24.934
Kind of like...

00:28:24.934 --> 00:28:25.968
Nyquil chicken.

00:28:25.968 --> 00:28:28.634
People saw the recipe on TikTok,

00:28:28.634 --> 00:28:30.767
and now the FTA is saying,
stay away.

00:28:30.767 --> 00:28:33.801
It sounds gross, but if you fry
it and throw it in a bucket,

00:28:33.801 --> 00:28:35.000
it's perfect for...

00:28:35.000 --> 00:28:36.567
Donald Trump.

00:28:36.567 --> 00:28:37.634
[ Laughter ]

00:28:37.634 --> 00:28:39.801
This latest lawsuit...

00:28:39.801 --> 00:28:42.667
[ Applause ]

00:28:42.667 --> 00:28:45.601
He's in serious legal trouble,
but honestly,

00:28:45.601 --> 00:28:47.567
by now, it kind of
feels like we've...

00:28:47.567 --> 00:28:50.234
seen this movie before.

00:28:50.234 --> 00:28:52.968
If you forgot, "Avatar" is about
oddly colored creatures

00:28:52.968 --> 00:28:54.367
that have fallen on hard times,

00:28:54.367 --> 00:28:56.601
which sounds a lot like...

00:28:56.601 --> 00:28:57.968
Donny T.

00:28:57.968 --> 00:28:59.200
[ Laughter ]

00:28:59.200 --> 00:29:01.033
When Trump was interviewed
by state officials,

00:29:01.033 --> 00:29:02.234
he pleaded the fifth,

00:29:02.234 --> 00:29:03.734
because when it came to
answering questions,

00:29:03.734 --> 00:29:04.734
he was too...

00:29:04.734 --> 00:29:05.734
chicken.

00:29:05.734 --> 00:29:07.067
Come on, guys!

00:29:07.067 --> 00:29:09.767
Don't make Nyquil chicken
or Tamiflu turkey

00:29:09.767 --> 00:29:11.501
or Robitussin ribs.

00:29:11.501 --> 00:29:13.267
That stuff will make you turn...

00:29:13.267 --> 00:29:14.934
