00:29:14.934 --> 00:29:17.968
Back in '09,
"Avatar" made over $2 billion,

00:29:17.968 --> 00:29:19.267
which is also how much...

00:29:19.267 --> 00:29:21.501
Trump said
his apartment's worth.

00:29:21.501 --> 00:29:23.834
And if you think that's legal,
you must be high on...

00:29:23.834 --> 00:29:25.634
sizzurp chicken.

00:29:25.634 --> 00:29:27.567
So in conclusion...

00:29:27.567 --> 00:29:29.033
nations unite...

00:29:29.033 --> 00:29:30.567
losing fight.

00:29:30.567 --> 00:29:31.868
Back in blues...

00:29:31.868 --> 00:29:33.234
chicken snooze.

00:29:33.234 --> 00:29:35.234
This has been a "News Smash."

00:29:35.234 --> 00:29:39.200
♪♪

00:29:39.200 --> 00:29:41.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:29:41.667 --> 00:29:42.801
Hey, this is fun.

00:29:42.801 --> 00:29:44.501
Earlier tonight,
Elton John performed

00:29:44.501 --> 00:29:46.901
