of the White House.

00:29:46.901 --> 00:29:48.534
It was an exciting night
for the Bidens.

00:29:48.534 --> 00:29:50.868
The concert started right
after dinner, at 3:00 PM.

00:29:50.868 --> 00:29:53.434
[ Laughter ]

00:29:55.400 --> 00:29:57.767
Biden hosting Elton John at
the White House makes sense.

00:29:57.767 --> 00:29:59.834
There's no better anthem for
a 79-year-old president

00:29:59.834 --> 00:30:01.567
than a song called
"I'm Still Standing."

00:30:01.567 --> 00:30:02.601
Don't you think?

00:30:02.601 --> 00:30:04.200
[ Laughter ]

00:30:04.200 --> 00:30:06.934
Hey, I saw that it's
National Dog Week, everybody.

00:30:06.934 --> 00:30:10.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:30:11.667 --> 00:30:15.434
And to celebrate, Tinder is
putting rescue dogs on their app

00:30:15.434 --> 00:30:18.100
