with potential owners.

00:30:18.100 --> 00:30:20.000
It's exactly the same
as normal Tinder.

00:30:20.000 --> 00:30:22.434
Everyone says they enjoy food
and long walks on the beach.

00:30:22.434 --> 00:30:24.200
[ Laughter ]

00:30:24.200 --> 00:30:26.634
And finally, a popular
craft beer in Australia

00:30:26.634 --> 00:30:30.467
was recalled over concerns
of "excess alcohol."

00:30:30.467 --> 00:30:31.701
[ Laughter ]

00:30:31.701 --> 00:30:33.300
Meanwhile, the people who
